#N0.40#########################################################################
DATA,64,"External servo-on enable",0,1,0x00,2
	"Enables the external servo-on (EX-SON) input. Regardless of this setting, it is enabled"
	"when using the normal mode auto-tuning or the frequency characteristic analysis."
	"0: Disable (to be used as EX-IN4 instead) "
	"1: Enable (When both active of EX-SON and Servo On of network, servo on)"
#N0.41#########################################################################
DATA,65,"Emergency stop enable",0,1,0x00,3
	"Enables the emergency stop (EMG-STP) input."
	"0: Disable"
	"1: Enable (If EMG-STP is open, Err.87 occurs.)"
	""
#N0.42#########################################################################
DATA,66,"Home input logic",0,1,0x00,3
	"Set the logic of Home input."
	"0: Normally closed"
	"1: Normally open"
	""
#N0.43#########################################################################
DATA,67,"Direction of motion",0,3,0x10,3
	"Set the positive direction of data via network and the assignment of CCWL/CWL on the response."
	"Note that on PANATERM, plus always indicates CCW."
	"0: + is CW (byte3 bit1, 0: CCWL, CWL), 1: + is CCW (byte3 bit1, 0: CCWL, CWL)"
	"2: + is CW (byte3 bit1, 0: CWL, CCWL), 3: + is CCW (byte3 bit1, 0: CWL, CCWL)"
#N0.44#########################################################################
DATA,68,"Numerator of output pulse ratio",1,32767,0x10,2
	"Set the number of output pulses per motor revolution."
	"Pr.45 = 0: Set the number of pulses per revolution. The resolution is (Pr.44 x 4)."
	"Pr.45 > 0: Output pulse resolution per revolution = (Pr.44 / Pr.45) x Encoder resolution."
	"When the source of the pulse output is the external scale, do not set Pr.45 to 0. "
#N0.45#########################################################################
DATA,69,"Denominator of output pulse ratio",0,32767,0x10,2
	"Set the number of output pulses per motor revolution."
	"Pr.45 = 0: Set the number of pulses per revolution. The resolution is (Pr.44 x 4)."
	"Pr.45 > 0: Output pulse resolution per revolution = (Pr.44 / Pr.45) x Encoder resolution."
	"When the source of the pulse output is the external scale, do not set Pr.45 to 0. "
#N0.46#########################################################################
DATA,70,"Pulse output logic inversion",0,3,0x10,2
	"Select the source and the B-phase logic of the pulse output."
	"When only using the external scale, 2 or 3 can be set."
	"0: Non invert of encoder,        1: Invert of encoder"
	"2: Non invert of external scale, 3: Invert of external scale"
#N0.47#########################################################################
DATA,71,"Z-phase of external scale setup",0,32767,0x10,2
	"When the source of the pulse output is the external scale, "
	"set an interval of Z-phase output with the number of A-phase pulses before multiplied by 4."
	"0: Z-phase not outputted."
 	"1-32767: Z-phase outputted."
