DATA,76,"Smoothing filter",0,7,0,2
	"Set the 1st order lag filter added to the position command."
	"Larger value yields smoother command, however, its delay becomes longer."
	"0:   Filter disabled"
 	"1-7: Filter enabled"
#N0.4D#########################################################################
DATA,77,"FIR filter setup",0,31,0x10,2
	"Set the FIR filter added to the position command."
	"This is a moving average filter, and the number of the averaging is (setting value + 1)."
	"Larger value yields smoother command, however, its delay becomes longer."
